ll  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]tale_coder_wait[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tale_coder_wait: give `PlanApprovalResult` wait fields and stamp a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonical `%wait(...)` directive onto the approved tale's coder [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]successor prompt.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Thread a wait spec through the host-owned epic launch[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]epic_launch_wait[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bead_work_wait[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]epic_launch_wait: pass an optional wait spec from `prepare_epic_launch` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through the epic launch monitor into the `sase bead work --wait` argv, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]including resume hints.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Accept `wait` on the plan gate approval options[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]gate_wait_input[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tale_coder_wait, epic_launch_wait[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate_wait_input: declare `wait` on the tale and epic approval option [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]schemas, validate it in the gate command, and route the parsed result [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into the coder prompt and the epic launch.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`sase plan approve --wait`[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]plan_approve_cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate_wait_input[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plan_approve_cli: add a `-w/--wait` option to `sase plan approve` that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validates the spec before anything is mutated and forwards it to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]approval executor.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Wait field in the ACE approval modal[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ace_approval_wait[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate_wait_input[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace_approval_wait: add an editable wait row to the ACE custom-approval [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]modal and forward the spec through both the neutral and legacy ACE [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]approval paths.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-vs","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-vs.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-8785293b1f4fc2a149d72f82ab464e52","started_at":"2026-08-30T11:23:49.919911+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"1e4642a40c94a13b91fe6eb50a837b1dc1d73db950608d1f6b1b6dbbf54e02a9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vs.land--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":1838326},"commits":{"digest":"66fd354794ab8eee703adafe9e226c59bf9a14d535a6bc9fd21dccec7c9425a1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vs.land--mon/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"28ffbe7ae6b798dadada03b65c69bf1891cf1e6b0b46a13262a7e13339f2d5b1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vs.land--mon/meta.json","size_bytes":704},"state":{"digest":"7a6e1316bd0670b84d509e7d28cb45f0b49223041dc7c5604a519ef3794d7689","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-vs.land--mon/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-vs.land--mon","local_name":"sase-vs.land--mon","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-vs","agent_clan_generation":"20260830072328","agent_session":"sase-vs.land","agent_session_role":"mon","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-vs","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name